  "plan": "I will write the Python code for `filter.py`. This script will use `sys` for arguments and preferably `BeautifulSoup` (from `bs4`) for robust parsing and manipulation, ensuring the removal of `<script>` tags and their contents. I will use multi-line echoing commands to create the file.",
